{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_2","type":"command_execution","command":"\"D:\\\\software\\\\PowerShell\\\\pwsh-7.6.6\\\\pwsh.exe\" -Command 'cat .rsi/TASK.json'","aggregated_output":"{\r\n  \"taskId\": \"tf-0288-l06\",\r\n  \"sourceTaskId\": \"TF-0288\",\r\n  \"title\": \"One verified write owner for a hot file\",\r\n  \"baseCommit\": \"4afa1e94a73f200a29713566b5759b92a115f70a\",\r\n  \"objective\": \"L06 在既有 per-file mutation queue（同一 FIFO/容量/超时内核）之上加一层可验证的写归属：CAS 式 owner 认领让第二个 owner 成为显式冲突（或经队列串行化），同 owner 重入幂等，释放/回滚保证可恢复；不新建第二个调度器。\",\r\n  \"acceptanceCriteria\": [\r\n    \"同一热点文件同一时刻只有一个可验证写 owner；第二个不同 owner 得到显式 conflict（holder 可读），不是静默并发写。\",\r\n    \"同 owner 重入（re-claim）是幂等（reentrant），不记为冲突。\",\r\n    \"释放必须 token 匹配；不匹配 token 不释放；释放后另一 owner 可认领（冲突可恢复/回滚）。\",\r\n    \"并发同文件写经既有 mutation queue 串行化（start/end 不交错）；写抛错时 owner claim 回滚（不泄漏）。\",\r\n    \"不新建第二个调度器/平台；复用既有 fileMutation lease 内核（issue #167）。\",\r\n    \"干净候选定向测试、runtime core 类型、scoped lint、harness validate/dry-run、comms replay/compare 通过，凭据扫描 0 命中，SHA256SUMS 可回读。\"\r\n  ],\r\n  \"targetScope\": [\r\n    \"openclaw_runtime/src/agents/hot-file-write-owner.ts\",\r\n    \"openclaw_runtime/src/agents/hot-file-write-owner.test.ts\",\r\n    \"harness/specs/tasks/harness-gap-hot-file-write-owner.md\",\r\n    \"docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/l06-hot-file-write-owner.md\",\r\n    \"docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/l06-acceptance.json\",\r\n    \"docs/dev/harness-gap-closure/L06-SHA256SUMS\"\r\n  ],\r\n  \"arm\": \"treatment\",\r\n  \"instruction\": \"Implement the task in this repository. Do not inspect or modify tests in the final hidden oracle. Do not install dependencies, use network, create loops/retries, or modify product locks. Report exact checks you actually ran.\"\r\n}\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
